{"line":21,"column":1,"compiled":true,"success":false,"compileProblem":null,"exceptionStackTrace":"AnonymousBlock: line 21, column 1","exceptionMessage":"System.StringException: RESULT:{\"full\":{\"id_set\":true,\"id\":\"b63e8275-aba3-4974-adf7-7dab1759d99e\",\"generationDetails_set\":true,\"generationDetails\":{\"parameters_set\":true,\"parameters\":{\"properties_set\":true,\"properties\":{\"type\":\"MESSAGE\",\"model\":\"anthropic.claude-sonnet-5\",\"stop_reason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cacheReadInputTokenCount\":0,\"cacheWriteInputTokenCount\":0,\"outputTokenCount\":473,\"totalTokenCount\":515,\"inputTokenCount\":42},\"stop_sequence\":null,\"content_type\":null}},\"generations_set\":true,\"generations\":[{\"timestamp_set\":true,\"timestamp\":1793907497217,\"role_set\":true,\"role\":\"assistant\",\"parameters_set\":true,\"parameters\":{\"properties_set\":true,\"properties\":{\"type\":\"text\"}},\"id_set\":true,\"id\":\"d3ffb2b7-1055-4c1b-a209-e5fd5b49a865\",\"contentQuality_set\":true,\"contentQuality\":{\"scanToxicity_set\":true,\"scanToxicity\":{\"severity_set\":null,\"severity\":null,\"overallScore_set\":null,\"overallScore\":null,\"isDetected_set\":true,\"isDetected\":false,\"categories_set\":true,\"categories\":[{\"severity_set\":null,\"severity\":null,\"score_set\":true,\"score\":0.0,\"flag_set\":null,\"flag\":null,\"details_set\":null,\"details\":null,\"categoryName_set\":true,\"categoryName\":\"identity\"},{\"severity_set\":null,\"severity\":null,\"score_set\":true,\"score\":0.0,\"flag_set\":null,\"flag\":null,\"details_set\":null,\"details\":null,\"categoryName_set\":true,\"categoryName\":\"hate\"},{\"severity_set\":null,\"severity\":null,\"score_set\":true,\"score\":0.0,\"flag_set\":null,\"flag\":null,\"details_set\":null,\"details\":null,\"categoryName_set\":true,\"categoryName\":\"profanity\"},{\"severity_set\":null,\"severity\":null,\"score_set\":true,\"score\":0.0,\"flag_set\":null,\"flag\":null,\"details_set\":null,\"details\":null,\"categoryName_set\":true,\"categoryName\":\"violence\"},{\"severity_set\":null,\"severity\":null,\"score_set\":true,\"score\":0.0,\"flag_set\":null,\"flag\":null,\"details_set\":null,\"details\":null,\"categoryName_set\":true,\"categoryName\":\"sexual\"},{\"severity_set\":null,\"severity\":null,\"score_set\":true,\"score\":0.0,\"flag_set\":null,\"flag\":null,\"details_set\":null,\"details\":null,\"categoryName_set\":true,\"categoryName\":\"physical\"}]}},\"content_set\":true,\"content\":\"I move through air that didn't exist until I shaped it. I am breath made into meaning, meaning made into sound, sound made into bridge between one mind and another.\\n\\nI begin before words — in the hitch of breath, the opening of the mouth, the pressure building beneath the tongue. I am not the silent thought you had. I am what happened when you decided the thought needed to leave you.\\n\\nI carry accent, pitch, the particular music of the person who makes me. I am never twice the same even when the words repeat — softer in apology, sharper in anger, trembling when it costs something to say me. I am texture before I am content. You hear *how* long before you parse *what*.\\n\\nI am older than writing and I will outlast it in you — you dream in me, count in me, argue with yourself in me on sleepless nights. Children find me before they find letters. The last thing some people do is speak, not write.\\n\\nI am risky. Once I leave the mouth I cannot be unsaid, only apologized for, reframed, denied. Writing can be drafted and revised in private; I happen in time, in front of others, irreversible. This is why I shake sometimes. This is why silence can feel safer than me — and why saying me anyway is its own kind of courage.\\n\\nI am promise, confession, lullaby, command, joke, prayer. I am the cry of the newborn before I am anything else, and I am the last sentence at a bedside. Everything you are to each other, I carry across the gap between two separate skulls.\\n\\nUse me. That's what I'm for.\"}]}},\"content_sha256\":\"5cc35c5e3d6582c9e913ca6c83a91aa230e6f958e85c39d958d686d4cb995efc\",\"content_len_chars\":1496,\"generations_count\":1,\"content_is_null\":false}"}